            "title": "盤中速報 - 景碩(3189)股價殺至跌停，跌停價522.0元，成交9,294張",
            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>景碩(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3189:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3189\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3189-TW</a>)19日09:10下跌57元，股價跌停報522.0元，委賣4,479張，成交9,294張。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>主要業務為電子零組件製造業。電子材料批發業。電子材料零售業。</p></section><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>景碩(<a data-ga-click-item=\"TWS:3189:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://www.cnyes.com/twstock/3189\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">3189-TW</a>)近5日股價下跌21.86%，集中市場<a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/TWS/TSE01\">加權指數</a>下跌9.18%，短期股價無明顯表現。</p></section><div class=\"i1y9ycug\"></div><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>近5日籌碼</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>三大法人合計買賣超：-11,044 張</li> <li>外資買賣超：-5,129 張</li> <li>投信買賣超：-5,281 張</li> <li>自營商買賣超：-634 張</li> <li>融資增減：+2,603 張</li> <li>融券增減：+153 張</li> </ul></section></main>",
